A new year begins. Recruitment averages are doing well, but have reduced slightly compared to performances from earlier years. [? if ftregions_strngth < 1 : We have virtually no competition within our regional theme's niche. ?][? if ftregions_strength < 3 : Regions similar to our own struggle to compete against us. ?][? if ftregions_strength >= 3 : Our competition with similar regions is strong, but we are coming out on top. ?][? if ftregions_strength >= 8 : We are desperately competing with similarly-themed regions for endorsements. ?]

[? if stl_is_in_s7 = 0 : For better or for worse, Starlight & Horizon is no longer in the Sovereign Seven. ?][? if stl_is_in_s7 = 1 and stls7relations > 5 : Starlight & Horizon is in good standing with its allies in the Sovereign Seven. ?][? if stl_is_in_s7 = 1 and stls7relations <= 5 : Relationships with Sovereign Seven members have soured significantly over time. Our international partners and citizens expect the government to address this. ?]   
